Erevos Messenger uses code from mautrix-meta (https://github.com/mautrix/meta),
Copyright (C) Tulir Asokan and contributors, under the GNU AGPL v3 or later.

The Signal part uses presage (https://github.com/whisperfish/presage) and
libsignal-service-rs, under the GNU AGPL v3, and libsignal by Signal Messenger
under the GNU AGPL v3.

The Session part uses libsession-util and libsession-util-android
(https://github.com/session-foundation), under the GNU GPL v3, and follows the
protocol code of session-android (GPL v3). The word list in
android/app/src/main/assets/session/english.txt and the seed node certificates
next to it come from session-android.
